
# Some proposals carry an activity-object
:SPECIAL_STATE
"proposes that $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)"  /pres proposal $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP) $activityObj(KIND)  .
"proposed that $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)"  /past proposal $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP) $activityObj(KIND)  .
"urged that $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)"     /past urge $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)                          .

:STATE
"proposes that"                     /pres proposal              .
"proposed that"                     /past proposal              .
"has the goal: "                    /pres goal                  .
"had the goal: "                    /past goal                  .
"is pregnant by"                    /pres pregnant_by           .
"was pregnant by"                   /past pregnant_by           .
"is"                                /pres isa                   .
"was"                               /past isa                   .
"does"                              /pres do                    .
"did"                               /past do                    .
"is near"                           /pres near                  .
"was near"                          /past near                  .
"knows "                            /pres know                  .
"knew "                             /past know                  .
"has a conversation with"           /pres conversation          .
"had a conversation with"           /past conversation          .

